{"id":"e2fd66d2bd1c2f53","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-boolean-qcsp.md","title":"Boolean qCSP Instances and Value","display":"df-boolean-qcsp — Boolean qCSP Instances and Value","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-boolean-qcsp","aliases":["28-df-boolean-qcsp"],"display":"df-boolean-qcsp — Boolean qCSP Instances and Value","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 11.11","source_printed_pages":"244","source_pdf_pages":"270","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-boolean-qcsp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-boolean-qcsp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-boolean-qcsp — Boolean qCSP Instances and Value"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 11.11"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"244"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"270"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,q,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n,q,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi=(\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_m)\">\\(\\Phi=(\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_m)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi_i:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\phi_i:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u|_S\">\\(u|_S\\)</span> 为坐标限制；重复约束作为列表重数计入平均。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QCSP}_{n,q}(\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\\forall i\\in[m]\\ \\exists S_i\\subseteq[n]\\ [|S_i|\\le q\\land\\forall u,v\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ (u|_{S_i}=v|_{S_i}\\Rightarrow\\phi_i(u)=\\phi_i(v))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{QCSP}_{n,q}(\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\\forall i\\in[m]\\ \\exists S_i\\subseteq[n]\\ [|S_i|\\le q\\land\\forall u,v\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ (u|_{S_i}=v|_{S_i}\\Rightarrow\\phi_i(u)=\\phi_i(v))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\max_{u\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}\\frac1m\\sum_{i=1}^m\\phi_i(u),\\qquad \\operatorname{Sat}(\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\max_{u\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}\\frac1m\\sum_{i=1}^m\\phi_i(u),\\qquad \\operatorname{Sat}(\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限赋值集与非空约束列表保证最大值达到，避免空列表的零分母。约束依赖至多q个坐标，本地表示不强行要求正好q个互异坐标；与原书接口等价。补足PCP归约和下一阶段非二元CSP的Boolean基例。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 11.11；印刷页 244；PDF 页 270。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第11章的 Boolean qCSP Instances and Value，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,q,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi=(\\phi_1,\\ldots,\\phi_m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi_i:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"u|_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{QCSP}_{n,q}(\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\\forall i\\in[m]\\ \\exists S_i\\subseteq[n]\\ [|S_i|\\le q\\land\\forall u,v\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ (u|_{S_i}=v|_{S_i}\\Rightarrow\\phi_i(u)=\\phi_i(v))].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\max_{u\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}\\frac1m\\sum_{i=1}^m\\phi_i(u),\\qquad \\operatorname{Sat}(\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(\\Phi)=1.","display":true}],"bytes":1733,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-328","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-qcsp]]、[[28-lem-clause-assignment-graph]]、[[28-prop-independent-set-product]]、[[28-prop-vertex-cover-gap-transfer]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}